n}\n.hr.av-6jrz83-81bbc92996f94d7911a014822d02a0e9 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-6jrz83-81bbc92996f94d7911a014822d02a0e9 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-4hqxv7-1d110f7b4e96b48678363e422b883294 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-4hqxv7-1d110f7b4e96b48678363e422b883294 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mnhdcw0h-6b9071f228c56e559527c0be3aee6baa '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1073\">Le monde de l\u2019automobile se r\u00e9unit en Argentine &#8211; et VENOL MOTOR OIL sera au rendez-vous ! Ce mois d\u2019avril, nous nous rendons \u00e0 Buenos Aires pour Automechanika 2026.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1196\">Nous sommes ravis d\u2019annoncer que l\u2019\u00e9quipe VENOL MOTOR OIL participera au prochain salon Automechanika Buenos Aires 2026 !<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1479\">Cet \u00e9v\u00e9nement repr\u00e9sente une excellente opportunit\u00e9 de pr\u00e9senter notre gamme de produits et de d\u00e9velopper de nouvelles relations commerciales sur le march\u00e9 sud-am\u00e9ricain. Si vous pr\u00e9voyez d\u2019y participer, n\u2019h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 nous contacter pour planifier une rencontre avec nos experts.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1546\">Quand : <strong>08-11 avril 2026<\/strong><br data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1512\" \/>O\u00f9 : <strong>Buenos Aires, Argentine<br \/>\n<\/strong>Vous nous trouverez dans le <strong>Hall 1, stand J-19<br \/>\n<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1672\"><strong data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1596\">R\u00e9servez votre rendez-vous d\u00e8s aujourd\u2019hui :<\/strong><br data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1599\" \/>\ud83d\udcde +48 669 930 600 &#8211; Milena Kotynia<br data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1637\" \/>\ud83d\udcde +48 669 460 200 &#8211; Jan Fabisiak<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-37yhqb-7a3eec6f20d10144888f789d62f712b7 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-4  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-mnhdc2cd-911af8bf07d2ccf110001e29b7cc8f71\">\n.avia-image-container.av-mnhdc2cd-911af8bf07d2ccf110001e29b7cc8f71 img.avia_image{\nbox-shadow:none;\n}\n.avia-image-container.av-mnhdc2cd-911af8bf07d2ccf110001e29b7cc8f71 .av-image-caption-overlay-center{\ncolor:#ffffff;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-image-container av-mnhdc2cd-911af8bf07d2ccf110001e29b7cc8f71 av-styling- avia-align-center  avia-builder-el-5  avia-builder-el-no-sibling '   itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><div class=\"avia-image-container-inner\"><div class=\"avia-image-overlay-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class='wp-image-5124 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-5124 avia_image ' src=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-4-1030x1030.jpeg\" alt='' title='Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026'  height=\"1030\" width=\"1030\"  itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" srcset=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-4-1030x1030.jpeg 1030w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-4-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Venol-Buenos-Aires-2026-4-80x80.jpeg 80w, https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04